{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act48side_level_act48side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act48side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act48side_level_act48side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"ME-1","storyName":"工作与时日","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"举办文物交换仪式的地点与时间尚未确定。在当地理事官里底娅的安排下，缇缇来到第一神殿重建现场参观。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act48side/level_act48side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act48side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["颓丧的男人","卡珊卓拉","助理祭司","缇缇","赫卡德墨","米奥","吕刻伊昂","清醒的工匠"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","duration":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_bg_69_g11_firsttemple_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"我又梦到了当初在游击队里的事，卡珊卓拉小姐。","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"charslot","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"这是您这个月第三次拜访恩底弥翁神殿，找我解读梦境，墨格斯先生。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"您梦到的……仍是七年前的那个夜晚？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"是的……","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"那个漆黑的夜晚，我们躲在树林里。萨尔贡人就堵在林子外，寻找我们的踪迹。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"我们不能出声，更不能点灯，只能摸黑将手里的武器拆开。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"螺帽、弹簧、源石元件……我把施术单元的配件一个个地系到衣服和鞋子上，伪装成装饰品。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"恐惧令我浑身发冷，连源石元件划破手掌都毫无知觉，还以为手心里是汗水。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"天亮了，我们装成附近村庄的伐木工，从萨尔贡人面前走过。要是暴露了，我们十几个人都会死……","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"他们面无表情地挨个儿扫视我们。有一瞬间，我以为他们发现了破绽，惊慌之下被树根绊了一跤，摔进泥地。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"萨尔贡人哈哈大笑，说了一些像是嘲讽的话，用刀柄砸了我肩膀。但我很高兴，我知道我们安全了。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"……","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"最近这件事反复出现在我的梦里，您说……","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"您想知道，这是否是个神谕？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"卡珊卓拉小姐，去年在中央广场上，我亲眼见过英雄借您的声音开口，宣读他们的意志。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"您是米诺斯众英雄的代言者，也是雅赛努斯城中唯一能区分普通梦境与神谕的祭司。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"如果神谕为我指引的道路是再次拿起武器，那……即便我再恐惧……","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"请坐下来，先生，您的腿在打颤，脸色也很不好。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"米诺斯的英雄不会迫使一位饱受战争痛苦的子民，回到他的噩梦之中。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"您的意思是……？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"我想，您误读了神谕。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"智慧与勇气代替紧闭双眼的双月，照拂您和同伴，让你们在天亮时分脱困；您也从梦中醒来，迎接雅赛努斯美好的清晨……","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"英雄般的美德本该得到嘉许，但七年来弥久不散的痛苦，让您忽略了命运的枝头已经结出甘美的果实……","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"摘下它，先生，接受众英雄对您的赐福。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"赐福……对我这样普通的米诺斯人？","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"我们的神明与英雄，原本亦是普通的米诺斯人。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2081_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颓丧的男人","text":"感谢您，尊敬的卡珊卓拉小姐，我有些明白了……","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_2081_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":56},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":57},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2085_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":61},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":62,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理祭司","text":"卡珊卓拉小姐，我来替您的班。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2085_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"哦，原来已经这个时间了。今天来拜访神殿的客人很多。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2085_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理祭司","text":"最近您既要顾及恩底弥翁神殿的访客，又因为克瑞斯拉第一神殿主管祭司空缺，要为其代行文书工作……但您的时间和精力是有限的。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2085_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"不用担心我，芙里欧。解读神谕、代神之口……是我天生的职责。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2085_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理祭司","text":"正因如此，您应该比我更清楚，那位先生做的只是普通的梦，那不是神谕，根据哥伦比亚的说法——","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2085_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"他可能患有创伤后应激障碍，我知道。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2085_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理祭司","text":"那您为什么不直接告诉他……","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2085_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"领受神谕对每个米诺斯人来说都是值得骄傲的事，而他的眼神却充满愧疚和惊惧。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"他希望得到神的指引，却又害怕那个噩梦真是无法违抗的神谕。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"若他相信我解读出的只言片语，胜过相信自己，那我必须承担责任，至少让他过得轻松一些。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2085_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理祭司","text":"……","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2085_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理祭司","text":"随后我会送他一些安神的花草茶，联系医师关注他的情况。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2085_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"助理祭司","text":"您下午不是例行休假吗？请不要再为神殿的事操心了，去处理您的私事吧。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2085_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"你总是在为我分忧，芙里欧，谢谢。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":88},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":90},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"image","id":95},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_bg_69_g4_athenusstreet.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":97},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":98,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"真是抱歉，赫卡德墨先生。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我一到旅店就晕过去了，没想到睡了整整三个小时，害您在楼下等了那么久……","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"千万不要挂心，梅捷缇克缇小姐，等候也是理事官执笔人的工作之一。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"您看上去还是有些虚弱……真的要现在就去第一神殿重建现场参观吗？再休息一会儿也是可以的。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#2$2","focus":"r","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"那怎么行？要说现在有什么能让我迅速恢复状态，那就非克瑞斯拉第一神殿莫属了！","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"据说神殿的原址，正是米诺斯的建国英雄克瑞斯拉在群山中初次得到神谕的地方。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"她在那里建造的第一座神殿，也成了米诺斯的发源。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"萨尔贡人……侵占米诺斯后，将三座城邦改建为移动城市，受到战火侵害的克瑞斯拉第一神殿却被留在了原址。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#6$2","focus":"r","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"没想到时隔百年，雅赛努斯人决定重建这座神殿，我也因此有幸见到这座历史遗迹最初的风貌，真是令人期待！","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"您对米诺斯的历史倒是很了解……也少见地诚实。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"可惜，原本的第一神殿图纸已经逸失，重建无法完全还原它过去的风貌。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"不过，他们建造神殿的做派，倒是挺有“古风”的。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"古风？","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"“重振米诺斯的精神，就需效仿雅赛努斯的建城英雄们，完全自发地建造神殿。”","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"那位倡议人在全民投票前，用这句话打动了所有人，重建神殿的议题近乎全票通过。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"不需要具体的工程规划，不用确定人员安排，民众的热情和米诺斯人骨子里对英雄的崇拜，会筑成最完美的克瑞斯拉第一神殿。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"早就听说米诺斯人做事随心随性，但就是这份随性让他们取得了辉煌的艺术成就……果然如此！","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"多谢赞美，但愿神殿能尽早完工……","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"仿古重建……有意思！赫卡德墨先生，那位提出神殿重建的倡议人，想必是位心怀大志，又极得民心的英雄人物吧？","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"呃，要怎么形容那位丰蹄小姐呢……","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"（喂，他怎么思考那么久，难道是你问了什么不该问的？）","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"charslot","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"（就算是这样，赫卡德墨先生看着面善，应该也不会计较的，米诺斯人爱好诗歌，说不定是在斟酌措辞。）","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"那个……","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"再给我三秒钟，梅捷缇克缇小姐。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"好、好的。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":152},{"type":"multiline","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"……三，二，一……","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"multiline","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"好！","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"您想好了？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"不，五点整了，我该下班了。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"啊？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"梅捷缇克缇小姐，您的问题等我明天上班后再给您解答，祝您参观愉快。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"可……我们甚至还没走到第一神殿啊？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"喏，看到那堆脚手架了没，这条大街离神殿正门就几步路，麻烦您自行前往啦。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"等等——","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"啊，我看到了熟人，他正等我喝酒呢。那人脾气太差，要是迟到我可就完蛋了，再见！","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"……","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"咳，正好我还发愁，要是这理事官的执笔人只带我看些标准景点，回去没有谈资可怎么办。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"你还挺会替别人打圆场！","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"这黎博利小子看着毕恭毕敬的，晾了他三个小时都不生气，敢情正好让他上班偷懒了！","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"好啦，别抱怨了。反正时间还早，我们先在附近多逛逛。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"这里可是英雄之乡，指不定我们就能一脚踏进哪位英雄的叙事诗里呢？","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"我看出来了，你就是奔着冒险才愿意出差的！","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"唉，我当初离开大巴扎，就是想找个有钱人养老才挑中了你，谁知道你是个不安分的麻烦精……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":198},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"缇缇！别到处乱跑，等等我啊！","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"image","id":209},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_69_g7_firsttemple.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":211},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$farce_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_farce_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":212,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"……","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"可算逮到你了！","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":228},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"image","id":235},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_bg_69_g11_firsttemple_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"200,0","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"200,0","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"离我远一点。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"怎么，故意疏远祭司学院的同窗？我们在题罗斯神殿一起参加辩论大赛的时候，你的表情可比现在热情多了。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"你的声音，太吵。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"看来你已经知道我是来找你辩论的了？","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"放心吧，要是你辩输了，我会骄傲地用这副嗓子和这只喇叭，把你的败绩用标准的六步格编成诗歌传颂出去的。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"再说了，“狂响的声筒”这个名号不还是你给我取的吗？作为回礼，我也给你取了一个——","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"“善辩的石头”！“狂响的声筒”！","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"太好了，你们这对雅赛努斯城的旷世辩才都在，我们有救了！","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"快跟我走一趟吧，苹果果农正在神殿里大吵大闹，偏说神殿工人故意拖延采石料的时间，不让苹果晒到太阳，想毁掉今年的收成。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"charslot","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"等等，帕拉斯小姐呢？虽然神殿是民众自发修建的，但她是重建神殿的第一倡议人，发生纠纷你们不都会找她处理吗？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"别提了，帕拉斯小姐最近忙得不可开交，昨天晚上就不见了，指不定又被谁叫去了。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"唉，一开始大家听说自发建神殿的事，都想效仿英雄参与重建，有空的就多干点儿活，有事了就暂时离开。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"谁能想到现在变得这么混乱，还耽搁了移动城市开往日照区的时间。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"两位青年才俊行行好，各代表一方帮我们辩出个解决方法来……再不济，辩出输赢也行啊！","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"没想到我们两个站在一起，就会自动让人联想到辩论……","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"所以我都说了——离我远点，声音轻点。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"硬石头，别仗着自己脑子转得快就说话这么跳跃，谁能知道你是这个意思！","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"不对啊，本来我就是嘴痒想找你辩论，这不正好？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"……","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"我还有事。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"认识这么多年，你还是用这个借口。这般平庸的口才，真不知道你当初是怎么拿到辩论冠军的。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"多谢你。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"……别想用激将法蒙混过关。这几年你总是一听我提辩论就跑，别忘了，我们还差一场比赛没有完成。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"快来，你想代表果农还是神殿工人？","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"认识这么多年，你也应当知道我不会说谎。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"唉……我要去新建的感染者办事处拿药，现在可以让开了吗？","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"什么……","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"治疗矿石病的药？他不是上周三刚领过……病情怎么发展得这么快？","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"不行，我得确认一下。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"哎！怎么都走了啊！","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的工匠","text":"那群苹果果农和我们的人可都要打起来了，这下还能找谁解决问题啊，总不能大街上随便拉一个看得顺眼的吧！","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"charslot","id":321},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","duration":"1","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"哇，米奥你看，神殿里好热闹！看来雅赛努斯民众重建第一神殿的热情真是十分高涨啊，搞得我也想参与一下了！","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"欸，那边的工匠先生，您是不是在找人帮忙呀？","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"image","id":334}],"characters":["颓丧的男人","卡珊卓拉","助理祭司","缇缇","赫卡德墨","米奥","吕刻伊昂","清醒的工匠"]}